From b0187aa42dc5219c39a204b3d63a66690614da8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:22:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Host Events: display-name search, Bloxlink identity
 verification, signed sessions

- Bot keeps a cached member list and searches display name, username and nickname (substring), shown as DisplayName (username); picker now shows errors instead of failing silently
- Host identity is verified through Bloxlink (needs BLOXLINK_API_KEY) so a Discord account can only be claimed by the Roblox account it is linked to
- roblox-oauth issues a signed 7-day session token; new single host-events function verifies it and checks can_host_events server-side on every call, replacing the three open functions
- DisplayName (Username) format used in lists across Points, Members, HR, Divisions, Promotions, Profile
- v20
